damx (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Modern UI rewrite: sidebar navigation, overview dashboard with live
    graphs, diagnostics page, compatibility/feature matrix, custom profiles,
    fan curves, RGB presets, system tray and in-app notifications.
  * Debian packaging: apt-installable package with desktop entry, systemd
    units for the daemon and the Nitro/PredatorSense button, and a
    damx-setup helper for drivers and button configuration.

